nec semper de mendacio onerant, II, 674 C.</ITEM> <ITEM>Stoicus christianismus, II, 20 B.</ITEM> <ITEM>STOLA, puellarum vestis, I, 688 B.</ITEM> <ITEM>STRABO auctor, II, 728 A.</ITEM> <ITEM>STRABO physicus coelum et terram dixit Deum, II. 260 B,
